---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="页面不存在">
  <section class="wrap hero" style="text-align:left;">
    <span class="eyebrow">404 · NOT FOUND</span>
    <h1>这一页还没被「做进系统」。</h1>
    <p class="lede">地址可能写错了，或内容还在搭建中。回到首页看看我正在做的事。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">回到首页 <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/systems/">看系统</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
